  "description": "UI components for DevInstance.BlazorToolkit: HDataGrid (sorting, paging, column grouping, resizing, selection, search highlights) with GridSettings, HSearchBar, error banner, page progress, data pagers, sortable header, loading progress and a page layout that hosts service execution state. Works in Blazor Server and WebAssembly.",
