  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "10.7.0\n- New: HDataGrid (DevInstance.BlazorToolkit.Components.DataGrid) binding to IModelList<TItem>, with HColumnTemplate, HSortableHeader, GridSettings and ColumnDescriptor. Sort, page, group by column, resize columns, select rows, render server search highlights (IModelListHighlights).\n- New: HSearchBar and SearchHighlight (DevInstance.BlazorToolkit.Components.Search).\n- Needs Bootstrap 5.3 CSS and JS bundle plus bootstrap-icons, and the stylesheet _content/DevInstance.BlazorToolkit.Components/css/blazortoolkit-components.css. The grid's script is an ES module it imports itself: no script tag.\n- Several grids and GridSettings on one page: give each pair its own HDataGrid.SettingsId / GridSettings.Id.\n- Requires DevInstance.WebServiceToolkit.Common 10.4.0 (via DevInstance.BlazorToolkit 10.7.0).\n\n10.6.0\n- First release. The UI components (ErrorMessageBanner, PageProgress, LoadingProgress, DataPager, ModelDataPager, SortableHeader, BlazorToolkitPageLayout) moved here from DevInstance.BlazorToolkit 10.5.x. The namespace (DevInstance.BlazorToolkit.Components) is unchanged; ServiceExecutionHostComponent stays in the core package.\n- Depends on DevInstance.BlazorToolkit with the same version; both packages are released together.\n- Fixed: SortableHeader's label link pointed to the literal URL \"SortLink\" when UrlTemplate was set.\nSee https://github.com/devInstance/BlazorToolkit/blob/master/docs/USAGE.md#ui-components and docs/components.md",
